% Overrides the rabbitmq:3-management-alpine image's stock
% [rabbitmq_management,rabbitmq_prometheus]. rabbitmq_management (web UI,
% useful for ops/debugging queue depth) stays; rabbitmq_prometheus is
% dropped -- SkyFollower's telemetry is entirely MQTT-based, so nothing
% ever scrapes its exporter, but it still runs its own HTTP listener and
% background stats collection for no purpose.
[rabbitmq_management].
